WEBVTT

01:27.140 --> 01:29.980
<b>AQUARION</b>

01:39.060 --> 01:43.530
I'll finish those programs 
so I can pilot Aquarion again!

01:43.920 --> 01:48.550
And then I'll meet Sun-kun to talk, 
and we'll protect both universes!

01:49.070 --> 01:50.330
Don't worry!

01:50.880 --> 01:53.740
Once I'm in Aquarion, it'll all work out.

01:56.130 --> 02:00.600
<i>New developments in the stabbing murder of 
a female middle school student in Enoshima.</i>

01:59.930 --> 02:03.510
<b>Satela</b>

01:59.930 --> 02:03.510
<b>Fujisawa</b>

01:59.930 --> 02:03.510
<b>Middle School Girl Stabbed to Death  Suspect at Large</b>

02:00.600 --> 02:03.510
<i>Police have obtained surveillance video</i>

02:03.510 --> 02:06.640
<i>of a female student at the same school
 who is now a person of interest.</i>

02:06.640 --> 02:08.090
<i>They are currently attempting to locate her.</i>

02:12.720 --> 02:15.940
Hana-chan really did do it.

02:18.280 --> 02:21.410
Today will be the final day 
of your Element training.

02:21.410 --> 02:22.180
Huh?

02:22.930 --> 02:25.010
According to DEAVA's most recent prediction,

02:25.010 --> 02:28.510
the prophesied event should occur
 within the next 72 hours.

02:29.490 --> 02:31.100
Within 72 hours...

02:31.500 --> 02:34.290
When you finish training, 
I'd like you all to rest and wait.

02:34.710 --> 02:36.760
Otori-kun and Tsukishiro-kun,

02:36.760 --> 02:40.300
try to complete at least one program and 
then concentrate on tuning your emotions.

02:40.300 --> 02:41.560
Wait a minute.

02:43.210 --> 02:44.180
I...

02:45.220 --> 02:47.560
I'm done fighting!

02:47.850 --> 02:49.400
Sorry I'm late!

02:50.970 --> 02:53.320
Amaha-san, hurry and take your place.

02:53.320 --> 02:54.500
Sensei.

02:54.500 --> 02:55.600
What?

02:55.600 --> 02:59.440
Is the union of universes 
really Sun-kun's wish?

02:59.730 --> 03:02.740
Of course it is. 
What are you even talking about?

03:02.740 --> 03:07.960
Then Sun-kun must also know of some 
way to stop them from uniting.

03:07.960 --> 03:11.630
That isn't how it works. 
Now take your position.

03:12.690 --> 03:15.500
It's just like it was with Ichiki-san.

03:15.500 --> 03:19.100
Yeah. It just means the universe's 
ability to self-correct is working.

03:21.100 --> 03:24.310
In other words, 
Momohime-senpai is already dead.

03:24.310 --> 03:25.450
Shut up!

03:25.450 --> 03:28.390
But it's the truth. You must know that.

03:29.940 --> 03:32.520
Hey, what happened to you, Toshi?

03:32.520 --> 03:33.590
What do you mean?

03:33.590 --> 03:36.310
You were never like this before. 
You were more—

03:36.310 --> 03:37.540
More of a loser?

03:37.540 --> 03:38.520
Huh?

03:39.620 --> 03:44.410
Yeah, that's right. Making fun of 
me always came so easy to you guys.

03:45.190 --> 03:47.940
I studied like crazy 
but still got the worst grades.

03:47.940 --> 03:49.940
I never stood out in sports either.

03:49.940 --> 03:54.450
Even I kept thinking, "How the hell 
did I get into this academy anyway?"

03:54.450 --> 03:55.530
But now...

03:56.720 --> 04:00.220
I've finally found a place where I belong.

04:00.660 --> 04:01.700
Where you belong?

04:03.240 --> 04:06.430
You guys don't need to worry 
about piloting Aquarion anymore.

04:06.430 --> 04:08.080
They've got me now.

04:08.080 --> 04:10.980
But Momohime-senpai will 
keep riding no matter what.

04:11.860 --> 04:14.470
Momohime-senpai will die in battle.

04:14.470 --> 04:17.190
Then the universe's ability to self-correct

04:17.190 --> 04:19.960
will kick in and make it so she 
was killed by Hana-chan instead.

04:19.960 --> 04:23.150
That universe will survive 
because it's going to win.

04:23.150 --> 04:25.260
The one that wins survives?

04:25.260 --> 04:27.770
Isn't that what they explained to us?

04:27.770 --> 04:31.790
The ability to self-correct indicates 
which side takes priority.

04:32.070 --> 04:35.700
Basically, Momohime-senpai 
fighting and dying in battle

04:35.700 --> 04:38.690
is a necessary condition for 
our universe's victory.

04:39.040 --> 04:40.620
How can you say that?

04:40.620 --> 04:43.470
And I can't let you mess this up.

04:43.470 --> 04:46.190
That's why I took Aquarion from you.

04:46.550 --> 04:47.300
Toshi!

04:52.230 --> 04:55.300
I don't understand your 
feelings at all, Toshi.

04:56.690 --> 04:59.360
And I'm glad I don't.

05:00.340 --> 05:03.410
Why? Why does it have to be her?

05:03.410 --> 05:04.820
Her who?

05:05.770 --> 05:06.780
Momohime...

05:06.780 --> 05:07.750
Sister!

05:09.610 --> 05:11.380
Wait a minute. Toshi-kun!

05:11.380 --> 05:11.990
Huh?

05:11.990 --> 05:15.100
Let me see Sun-kun! 
You can make that happen, right?

05:15.100 --> 05:16.650
Um...

05:17.960 --> 05:20.710
I told you already. He's busy right now.

05:20.710 --> 05:24.600
Then at least do something right 
now to get us back in Aquarion!

05:24.600 --> 05:25.720
No!

05:26.420 --> 05:27.090
Oh.

05:28.170 --> 05:29.160
Um...

05:29.490 --> 05:32.470
That might be the final battle! 
Let's go, guys!

05:32.470 --> 05:33.470
Don't go!

05:32.470 --> 05:33.470
You can't go!

05:33.880 --> 05:34.810
Why not?

05:36.400 --> 05:41.000
This isn't the final battle yet. 
It's fine. I'll go instead.

05:41.350 --> 05:44.520
Momohime-senpai, you just 
wait until it's your turn.

05:50.530 --> 05:55.870
<b>Satela</b>

05:50.530 --> 05:55.870
<b>Fujisawa</b>

05:50.530 --> 05:55.870
<b>Aquarion Naushizu Defeats Mythic Beast</b>

05:51.000 --> 05:55.870
<i>Enoshima Academy's Aquarion Naushizu 
has yet again defeated a mythic beast.</i>

05:59.650 --> 06:01.110
<i>Momohime-neesama...</i>

06:03.280 --> 06:07.340
<i>She disappeared again after that. 
She wasn't in the dorms either.</i>

06:07.770 --> 06:11.110
This is how it should be. Right, Sun-kun?

06:15.800 --> 06:20.650
Where in the world have you 
disappeared to, Sun-kun?

06:24.390 --> 06:25.100
<i>Why?</i>

06:25.920 --> 06:28.700
<i>Why does it have to be Momohime?</i>

06:28.700 --> 06:34.110
<i>She tried to save our universe, 
save Toshi, save the other universe...</i>

06:34.110 --> 06:37.220
<i>She tried to save everyone! So why her?</i>

06:40.660 --> 06:44.960
When Sun-kun isn't around, 
we have no idea what to do.

06:45.630 --> 06:49.130
Just tune the way your 
heart tells you, Toshi.

06:49.360 --> 06:50.980
Sun-kun!

06:52.350 --> 06:55.810
Where have you been all this time? 
You just disappeared!

06:55.810 --> 06:58.470
We were all really, really...

06:59.750 --> 07:00.630
Huh?

07:10.640 --> 07:12.120
Sun-kun...

07:23.540 --> 07:26.500
It's okay. I'll protect you.

07:53.770 --> 07:54.590
Huh?

07:55.080 --> 07:57.570
That's that Kamisama guy who was with Hana.

08:17.910 --> 08:21.220
How are you doing? 
Were you able to calm down a bit?

08:22.180 --> 08:23.060
Here.

08:23.870 --> 08:26.770
Thanks a bunch, Kamisama.

08:27.420 --> 08:28.060
Hana!

08:28.480 --> 08:31.280
Huh? Sakko-senpai?

08:40.570 --> 08:41.400
Huh?

08:44.440 --> 08:49.250
I don't remember nothin' about that night.

08:49.780 --> 08:54.660
When I came to my senses, my hands 
were all bloody, and I was running.

09:00.310 --> 09:03.240
Hey! Is that...

09:15.670 --> 09:18.620
At least I was able to 
take her here to hide.

09:20.200 --> 09:23.740
I don't feel it as strong anymore.

09:24.200 --> 09:27.100
The feeling that I want 
to kill Momohime-senpai.

09:27.710 --> 09:32.620
Could it mean I killed someone I loved?  
Because I feel satisfied now?

09:33.260 --> 09:39.060
But when I was running away, 
I coulda swore I saw Momohime-senpai.

09:39.350 --> 09:40.610
Well, yeah.

09:41.750 --> 09:48.290
I wanted to go back to check but thought 
I might actually kill her, so I kept running.

09:53.920 --> 09:54.900
I won't...

09:55.450 --> 09:58.540
I won't accept a future where she's dead!

09:58.540 --> 10:01.320
This is all a part of their plan.

10:02.080 --> 10:02.750
Huh?

10:03.710 --> 10:06.380
They take advantage of 
people's selflessness.

10:06.630 --> 10:10.980
They deceptively insist it is the right thing 
to do while sending people to their death.

10:10.980 --> 10:12.960
Always, every time.

10:13.770 --> 10:15.070
What are you even talking about?

10:15.070 --> 10:20.200
Even now, they claim to be carrying out 
the wishes of the child of the holy egg

10:20.200 --> 10:23.130
when what they truly want 
is to rule this world.

10:23.130 --> 10:24.800
They're using Sun?

10:25.720 --> 10:29.700
The first time I laid eyes on 
that boy was fifteen years ago.

10:31.010 --> 10:36.360
I had been assigned to the Space 
Preservation Agency facility on the continent.

10:41.070 --> 10:45.110
He was in a cradle made from 
the Mythic Star Stone.

10:45.530 --> 10:47.160
Mythic Star Stone?

10:47.450 --> 10:50.210
His face seemed somehow familiar.

10:50.210 --> 10:53.130
As if he was someone precious to me.

10:53.410 --> 10:57.420
So Kamisama, you worked at 
the Space Preservation Agency?

10:58.240 --> 11:00.730
The Space Preservation Agency is backed by

11:00.730 --> 11:04.540
a secret organization composed only 
of members of the ruling class.

11:05.180 --> 11:08.790
However, there was a split in ranks 
over the child of the holy egg,

11:08.790 --> 11:12.030
and the faction that broke off 
stole the child and escaped.

11:12.670 --> 11:17.160
The World Awakening Council 
and the Space Egg Council.

11:17.480 --> 11:21.740
I took on the task of finding 
them and returned to Japan.

11:22.120 --> 11:25.460
But then I came to my 
senses here in Enoshima.

11:25.460 --> 11:31.580
Egg, cradle, Mythic Star Stone... oh!

11:38.430 --> 11:41.100
Sakko, where you at?

11:41.100 --> 11:42.080
It's Rimiya.

11:43.170 --> 11:44.460
Over here!

11:52.530 --> 11:55.510
Sun-kun-senpai lent me this...

11:55.510 --> 11:57.140
egg?

12:21.380 --> 12:25.840
We present to our goddess, 
Mulua Satene, a new maiden and—

12:25.840 --> 12:26.680
Wait.

12:28.390 --> 12:32.110
The true cause of the goddess's 
decay has become clear.

12:32.340 --> 12:33.380
What?

12:38.350 --> 12:42.030
Twenty years ago, the spring of Soma, 
only accessible by shrine maidens,

12:42.030 --> 12:44.110
was defiled by a blasphemer's intrusion.

12:46.410 --> 12:49.500
And that person was the priest 
of the moon's blessing,

12:49.500 --> 12:50.500
Atea!

12:52.220 --> 12:53.690
I saw it myself.

12:54.040 --> 13:00.150
When I was still a child, I saw you enter 
 the shrine in the depths of the cave.

13:03.070 --> 13:04.180
Huh?

13:06.690 --> 13:09.120
Th-That was...

13:12.170 --> 13:13.480
No!

13:18.590 --> 13:19.450
It can't be.

13:21.310 --> 13:22.380
Behold!

13:22.860 --> 13:26.730
This is clear proof of 
the moon priest's sin!

13:32.130 --> 13:33.410
It can't be!

13:33.670 --> 13:35.910
Because I...

13:36.140 --> 13:38.080
Subdue the clan's members!

13:51.420 --> 13:52.680
Sedona.

13:53.420 --> 13:54.360
Haida.

13:55.220 --> 13:59.120
Please forgive me. This is my fault.

14:00.570 --> 14:06.920
Twenty years ago, Soma began 
to wither, much like she is today.

14:08.000 --> 14:14.360
At the time, people believed that the god 
protecting Soma was a monstrous snake.

14:15.750 --> 14:22.590
I made up my mind that a god that 
tortures people should itself be killed

14:22.590 --> 14:24.170
and entered the cave.

14:26.760 --> 14:32.520
The moment I saw her, she enchanted me, 
and I lost all will to slay her.

14:34.670 --> 14:37.390
The goddess and I engaged 
in intimate congress.

14:39.250 --> 14:41.600
Several days after I returned to town,

14:42.510 --> 14:48.910
I felt the goddess's voice calling me again, 
and I returned to the shrine of Soma.

14:49.650 --> 14:53.240
That is when, on a ledge next 
to the moon-viewing pool,

14:53.660 --> 14:57.130
I found you, Sedona.

14:59.840 --> 15:02.060
The world recovered.

15:02.560 --> 15:07.480
My reverence for the goddess 
spread throughout Naacal,

15:07.480 --> 15:09.590
and of it was born our faith.

15:10.270 --> 15:15.340
Thus, I became the priest 
of the moon's blessing.

15:16.770 --> 15:21.010
I do not consider my actions sinful.

15:27.910 --> 15:28.610
Huh?

15:30.690 --> 15:31.840
Father?

15:31.840 --> 15:33.010
My daughter!

15:33.400 --> 15:38.150
The entire story comes from a dream. 
The dream that I have inside the egg.

15:46.800 --> 15:49.020
I'll take that back now, Hana-chan.

15:53.320 --> 15:57.390
Hey, Sun! If this union is your wish, 
you must know a way to stop it, right?

15:57.390 --> 16:00.400
At this rate, Momohime will... 
You've got to do something!

16:01.090 --> 16:02.800
Did something happen to her?

16:02.800 --> 16:05.460
What are you talking about?
You must know!

16:05.460 --> 16:08.990
The universe's ability to self-correct 
made it so that she's killed!

16:10.420 --> 16:13.470
In fact, there is a way 
to prevent the union,

16:14.510 --> 16:17.740
but somebody still must die 
to maintain the balance.

16:37.850 --> 16:40.050
Sun! Where did you go? Sun!

16:39.260 --> 16:43.770
Sun-kun was here? 
Sun-kun, please come out. Sun-kun!

16:43.770 --> 16:44.690
Huh?

16:45.320 --> 16:49.260
Wait a minute. You didn't know 
where Sun-kun was either?

16:49.260 --> 16:51.030
I-I dunno.

16:51.030 --> 16:56.290
Anyway, we're gonna take you into custody 
for aiding and abetting a murder suspect.

17:07.680 --> 17:09.080
Is that...

17:11.230 --> 17:14.190
my father and mother?

17:30.640 --> 17:33.480
The Sun, the Moon, and Mars together?

17:33.480 --> 17:35.390
And look at how close they are!

17:35.820 --> 17:37.930
It just appears that way.

17:38.320 --> 17:40.940
As a natural phenomenon, 
it's physically impossible.

17:41.370 --> 17:44.290
When the Sun, the Moon, 
and Mars are in alignment,

17:44.290 --> 17:46.470
the melody of a new fusion 
begins to resonate.

17:47.300 --> 17:49.370
Is this what the prophecy meant?

17:50.900 --> 17:52.840
<i>All hands to battle stations.</i>

17:53.450 --> 17:56.630
<i>Repeat, all hands to battle stations.</i>

17:56.630 --> 17:58.020
Sensei!

17:59.090 --> 18:02.090
The final battle is upon us. 
Are you up to this?

18:05.650 --> 18:08.430
Where's Sakko? And Rimiya?

18:08.980 --> 18:10.260
Who's going to pilot?

18:10.720 --> 18:12.700
You're about to find out.

18:29.180 --> 18:31.740
A massive rift has formed 
in Fujisawa airspace!

18:43.670 --> 18:45.750
I will go!

18:50.560 --> 18:53.230
Open up! Let us out of here!

18:59.220 --> 19:02.200
The universes are finally starting to unite.

19:02.200 --> 19:03.170
Damn it!

19:03.730 --> 19:07.210
Hey, let us out! Somebody open the door!

19:10.920 --> 19:14.250
A massive Mythic Beast has 
appeared in Fujisawa airspace.

19:14.250 --> 19:17.610
Hatano-kun, Amaha-san, 
and Okuyama-kun have been deployed.

19:24.950 --> 19:30.270
DEAVA is saying that our universe's victory 
is conditional upon her deployment and death.

19:30.990 --> 19:36.100
That's why the World Awakening Council 
took the original Aquarion away from you.

19:36.630 --> 19:37.670
What?

19:40.110 --> 19:42.990
Don't worry. That's the 
vice principal's signal.

19:55.670 --> 19:57.800
Restrain that man!

20:04.670 --> 20:07.270
I came to rescue you. You have to hurry.

20:07.270 --> 20:09.340
But why do this for us?

20:13.320 --> 20:16.360
Munakata-sensei, you're 
with the Space Egg Council?

20:16.360 --> 20:18.740
This is the will of the 
child of the holy egg.

20:18.740 --> 20:19.910
Sun?

20:20.340 --> 20:24.470
Follow me. I'll take you to the hangars 
holding the original Vector Machines.

20:31.160 --> 20:33.500
<i>Why the hell is it so big?</i>

20:43.010 --> 20:46.840
It appears the time for us to 
use this has come as well.

20:50.220 --> 20:53.030
<i>The mobilization of Momohime Amaha</i>

20:53.030 --> 20:58.240
<i>has boosted DEAVA's prediction 
of a win to 99.9 percent.</i>

20:58.510 --> 21:01.770
And we can push it to 100 percent with this,

21:01.770 --> 21:03.460
the Staff of Zeus!

21:08.150 --> 21:10.490
Toshi-kun, Okuyama-kun, listen to me.

21:11.030 --> 21:12.030
What do you want?

21:12.370 --> 21:15.330
I'm going to accept all of its emotions.

21:15.330 --> 21:16.690
And then I'm gonna love it back!

21:16.690 --> 21:18.960
Huh? What are you talking about?

21:18.960 --> 21:21.400
I realized something in mythic space.

21:21.400 --> 21:25.440
The two universes aren't approaching 
to destroy each other.

21:25.440 --> 21:27.650
They're drawn to each other by love!

21:27.650 --> 21:31.440
But if they confront each other 
head-on, they'll both get hurt.

21:31.860 --> 21:32.720
<i>That's why...</i>

21:38.410 --> 21:41.160
The Vector Machine hangars are activated!

21:41.160 --> 21:43.900
Who the hell started up the originals?!

21:45.030 --> 21:49.210
Momohime, I'm not letting 
you die! Not a chance!

21:49.210 --> 21:51.030
Sister, wait for us.

21:51.030 --> 21:54.450
I've already decided I'm the one who 
gets to kill Momohime-senpai!

21:55.910 --> 21:58.840
<i>Bridge catapult, launch sequence initiated.</i>

21:59.490 --> 22:01.550
<i>Vector Siegel, launch!</i>

22:02.650 --> 22:05.080
<i>Iwaya cave, launch sequence initiated.</i>

22:06.410 --> 22:08.510
<i>Vector Tir, launch!</i>

22:10.610 --> 22:13.750
<i>Yacht harbor, launch sequence initiated.</i>

22:13.750 --> 22:16.140
<i>Vector Feoh, launch!</i>

22:18.500 --> 22:20.670
Rimiya, Hana, let's unite!

22:23.900 --> 22:25.400
Mythic Star Union!

22:25.400 --> 22:27.690
Go, Aquarion!

22:53.840 --> 22:56.110
<i>With the power of all of my mana,</i>

22:56.110 --> 22:58.560
<i>strike, arrow of love!</i>

23:07.080 --> 23:08.180
Our union!

23:13.520 --> 23:14.830
Okuyama-kun!

23:19.830 --> 23:20.610
Watch out!

23:27.880 --> 23:28.920
Sister!

23:28.920 --> 23:29.590
Senpai!

23:36.100 --> 23:38.900
Momohime!
